ng US ally Saudi Arabia into a pressure point in a war that began with the US and Israel attacking Iran in February. They targeted King Khalid International Airport and the financial centre in Riyadh with a large number of cruise missiles, Saree said. Saudi authorities did not immediately confirm the Houthi claims. The militia, which controls most of the populous parts of Yemen, has intensified attacks on the Saudi capital in recent days, saying it was responding to Saudi attacks in Yemen. REUTERS", "stages_full": {"windows": {"windows": 7, "cap": 12, "pct_body_read": 100, "offsets_text": [[75, 297], [298, 528], [529, 759], [760, 987], [988, 1250], [1250, 1493], [1493, 1554]]}, "scan_dates": {"spots": {"attribution": 7, "date": 2, "entity": 35, "event": 7, "negation": 1}, "dates": [["Nov 18", "2026-11-18"], ["Wednesday", "2026-11-18"]], "dates_resolved": 2, "anchor": "2026-11-18", "time_proxy": {"label": "time_proxy", "marker": "PROVISIONAL", "offset_days": [0, 0], "n": 2, "of": "resolved date minus published date, in days"}}, "facts": {"kinds": {"amount": 3, "date": 2, "name": 35, "triple": 21}, "stated": 37, "unbound": 24, "invalid": 0, "stated_amount": 3, "stated_date": 2, "quarantined": 0, "held": [], "items": [{"kind": "amount", "s": 39, "e": 44, "text": "three", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 116, "e": 121, "text": "three", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "amount", "s": 611, "e": 614, "text": "two", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "date", "s": 158, "e": 164, "text": "Nov 18", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "date", "s": 214, "e": 223, "text": "Wednesday", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 0, "e": 12, "text": "Saudi Arabia", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 77, "e": 89, "text": "Saudi Arabia", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 151, "e": 156, "text": "DUBAI", "status": "stated"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 167, "e": 195, "text": "Saudi Arabia's Civil Defence", "status": "unbound"}, {"kind": "name", "s": 273, "e": 278, "text": "Jaza